decision contract-selection
  Choose the contract with greater expected monetary value.

option contract-a
  Contract A.
option contract-b
  Contract B.

outcome contract-a-gain
  Contract A pays $100,000.
  quantity 100000 USD assumed
outcome contract-a-loss
  Contract A loses $20,000.
  quantity -20000 USD assumed
outcome contract-b-gain
  Contract B pays $55,000.
  quantity 55000 USD assumed
outcome contract-b-zero
  Contract B pays $0.
  quantity 0 USD assumed

link contract-a option-of contract-selection
link contract-b option-of contract-selection
link contract-a leads-to contract-a-gain
