  probability 0.10 assumed

claim contract-a-expected-value
  Contract A expected value is $52,000.
  quantity 52000 USD assumed
claim contract-b-expected-value
  Contract B expected value is $49,500.
  quantity 49500 USD assumed
claim final-answer
  The answer is A.

link contract-a-expected-value supports final-answer
  weight 1 assumed
link contract-b-expected-value supports final-answer
